{"story":{"id":"event-first-contact-critters-70","title":{"zh":"未知舰船","en":"Unknown Vessels"},"category":"society","kind":"family","image":"art/60299e8ce2b337a17e5b.webp","start":"first_contact_critters.70","chapters":2,"visible":true,"excerpt":{"zh":"在[This.System.GetName]星系中探测到的舰船似乎正在进行某种横跨星系的远征，这种生活方式对我们自己的族群而言并不陌生。他们没有表现出任何敌意，而是不断向我们方向重复广播信号。\n\n看到一个族群将家园安于星海之间而非任何星球之上，这种景象令人感到几分莫名的亲切。我们的[This.Owner.GetEnvoy][This.Leader.GetName]迫切希望能够进一步了解这些同为旅人的族群。","en":"The vessels detected in the [This.System.GetName] system appear to be on some kind of expedition across the galaxy, a way of life our own people know well. They have made no hostile moves, broadcasting repetitive signals in our direction instead.\n\nThere is som"},"review":{"status":"reviewed","date":"2026-10-13","reviewer":"c7b-society (resumed)","scope":{"zh":"商队首次接触：2个事件及阶段衔接。","en":"商队 first contact: 2 events and the stage hand-off."},"sources":["events/first_contact_NPC_country_types_events.txt:890-1069","common/first_contact/01_first_contact_space_fauna_and_NPCs.txt:332-370"],"uncertain":[],"guide":"public/summaries/event-first-contact-critters-70.md"},"tree":{"root":"n0","nodes":{"n0":{"doc":null,"children":["n1"]},"n1":{"doc":"first_contact_critters.70","parent":"n0","via":{"kind":"entry","triggers":[{"zh":"首次接触","en":"First contact"}]},"children":["n2","n3"]},"n2":{"doc":"first_contact_critters.75","parent":"n1","via":{"kind":"bridge","label":{"zh":"进入阶段：caravaneers_stage_2(难度5)","en":"Stage: caravaneers_stage_2 (difficulty 5)"},"conditional":true,"source":"content/stories/event-first-contact-critters-70.json","optionIndex":0,"option":"first_contact_critters.70.A"},"children":[]},"n3":{"ref":"n2","doc":"first_contact_critters.75","parent":"n1","via":{"kind":"bridge","label":{"zh":"进入阶段：caravaneers_stage_2(难度5)","en":"Stage: caravaneers_stage_2 (difficulty 5)"},"conditional":true,"source":"content/stories/event-first-contact-critters-70.json","optionIndex":1,"option":"first_contact_critters.70.E"}}}}},"chapters":[{"id":"first_contact_critters.70","kind":"event","title":{"zh":"未知舰船","en":"Unknown Vessels"},"texts":[{"zh":"在[This.System.GetName]星系中探测到的舰船似乎正在进行某种横跨星系的远征，这种生活方式对我们自己的族群而言并不陌生。他们没有表现出任何敌意，而是不断向我们方向重复广播信号。\n\n看到一个族群将家园安于星海之间而非任何星球之上，这种景象令人感到几分莫名的亲切。我们的[This.Owner.GetEnvoy][This.Leader.GetName]迫切希望能够进一步了解这些同为旅人的族群。","en":"The vessels detected in the [This.System.GetName] system appear to be on some kind of expedition across the galaxy, a way of life our own people know well. They have made no hostile moves, broadcasting repetitive signals in our direction instead.\n\nThere is something almost familiar about the sight of a people making their home among the stars rather than on any world. Our [This.Owner.GetEnvoy], [This.Leader.GetName], is eager to learn more about these fellow travelers."},{"zh":"在[This.System.GetName]星系中探测到的舰船似乎正在进行某种横跨星系的远征，这种生活方式对我们自己的族群而言并不陌生。他们没有表现出任何敌意，而是不断向我们方向重复广播信号。\n\n一群流浪者，和我们没什么不一样，但却不太受人欢迎。[This.Owner.GetEnvoy]，[This.Leader.GetName]对此不太感兴趣，但也愿意听听他们要说什么。","en":"The vessels detected in the [This.System.GetName] system appear to be on some kind of expedition across the galaxy, a way of life our own people know well. They have made no hostile moves, broadcasting repetitive signals in our direction instead.\n\nWanderers, not unlike ourselves, though the comparison is an unwelcome one. Our [This.Owner.GetEnvoy], [This.Leader.GetName], is unimpressed, but will hear what they have to say."},{"zh":"在[This.System.GetName]恒星系中侦测到的舰队似乎是某种目的不明的跨星系探险队。他们没有采取任何有敌意的举动，也没有任何显而易见的重型武器，反而他们似乎在反复但无目的地向我们的大致方向广播某种具有实际内容的信号。我们的[This.Owner.GetEnvoy]，[This.Leader.GetName]很困惑，但希望那些广播能帮助我们的[This.Owner.GetLinguists]翻译他们的语言。","en":"The vessels detected in the [This.System.GetName] system seem to be part of some sort of expedition across the galaxy, with purposes unknown. They have not made any hostile moves, nor is there any heavy weaponry in evidence - instead, they seem to be broadcasting repetitive but not particularly content-filled signals in our general direction. Our [This.Owner.GetEnvoy], [This.Leader.GetName], is confused, but hopes that the broadcasts will help our [This.Owner.GetLinguists] translate their language."},{"zh":"[This.System.GetName]恒星系似乎是某种未知起源的先进社会的家园。居住在恒星系的一系列空间站中，[This.Owner.GetEnvoy][This.Leader.GetName]留意到还有不少飞船在其间穿梭，同时还有一些目的不明的更大的远航舰队离开恒星系。他们似乎在向我们大致方向不断传播着重复的但没有实际内容的信号，这一进展令我们的[This.Owner.GetLinguists]感到困惑，但这有助于翻译他们的语言。","en":"The [This.System.GetName] system appears to be home to an advanced society of unknown origins. Dwelling in a series of space stations across the system, [This.Owner.GetEnvoy] [This.Leader.GetName] has observed multiple crafts flitting between them, as well as several larger expeditions leaving the system for unknown purposes. They seem to be broadcasting repetitive but not particularly content-filled signals in our general direction, a development which has confused our [This.Owner.GetLinguists], but may help them to translate their language."}],"sections":[],"image":"art/60299e8ce2b337a17e5b.webp","hidden":false,"choices":[{"key":"first_contact_critters.70.A","label":{"zh":"令人好奇。","en":"Curious."},"responses":[],"tooltips":[],"conditional":true,"next":[{"target":"first_contact_critters.75","kind":"bridge","conditional":true,"delayed":false,"sourceKind":"bridge","source":"content/stories/event-first-contact-critters-70.json","label":{"zh":"进入阶段：caravaneers_stage_2(难度5)","en":"Stage: caravaneers_stage_2 (difficulty 5)"},"story":"event-first-contact-critters-70"}],"terminal":false,"when":[[{"type":"other","key":"is_nomadic","arg":"no","scope":"owner","value":false}]],"labels":[{"label":{"zh":"令人好奇。","en":"Curious."},"when":[[{"type":"identity","key":"ethic_xenophobe","value":false,"label":{"zh":"排外主义","en":"Xenophobe"}},{"type":"identity","key":"ethic_militarist","value":false,"label":{"zh":"军国主义","en":"Militarist"}},{"type":"identity","key":"ethic_gestalt_consciousness","value":false,"label":{"zh":"格式塔意识","en":"Gestalt Consciousness"}}]]},{"label":{"zh":"令人恼火。","en":"Troubling."},"when":[[{"type":"identity","key":"ethic_xenophobe","value":true,"label":{"zh":"排外主义","en":"Xenophobe"}}],[{"type":"identity","key":"ethic_militarist","value":true,"label":{"zh":"军国主义","en":"Militarist"}}]]},{"label":{"zh":"蜂巢外的这些东西的行为确实很奇怪。","en":"The actions of those outside the hive are indeed strange."},"when":[[{"type":"identity","key":"auth_hive_mind","value":true,"label":{"zh":"蜂巢思维","en":"Hive Mind"}}]]},{"label":{"zh":"我们怎么才能彻底了解有机体。","en":"How can we fathom the ways of organic life?"},"when":[[{"type":"identity","key":"auth_machine_intelligence","value":true,"label":{"zh":"机械智能","en":"Machine Intelligence"}}]]}]},{"key":"first_contact_critters.70.E","label":{"zh":"他们已经声明了自己在这片区域的航路吗？","en":"Have they already claimed this region's Wayline routes?"},"responses":[],"tooltips":[],"conditional":true,"next":[{"target":"first_contact_critters.75","kind":"bridge","conditional":true,"delayed":false,"sourceKind":"bridge","source":"content/stories/event-first-contact-critters-70.json","label":{"zh":"进入阶段：caravaneers_stage_2(难度5)","en":"Stage: caravaneers_stage_2 (difficulty 5)"},"story":"event-first-contact-critters-70"}],"terminal":false,"when":[[{"type":"other","key":"is_nomadic","arg":"yes","scope":"owner","value":true}]]}],"next":[],"source":{"file":"events/first_contact_NPC_country_types_events.txt","line":889},"body":[{"pieces":[{"text":0}],"when":[[{"type":"other","key":"is_nomadic","arg":"yes","scope":"owner","value":true},{"type":"other","key":"is_unfriendly","arg":"yes","scope":"owner","value":false},{"type":"other","key":"is_same_value","arg":"event_target:caravaneer_home_country","scope":"contact_country","value":false}]]},{"pieces":[{"text":1}],"when":[[{"type":"other","key":"is_nomadic","arg":"yes","scope":"owner","value":true},{"type":"other","key":"is_unfriendly","arg":"yes","scope":"owner","value":true},{"type":"other","key":"is_same_value","arg":"event_target:caravaneer_home_country","scope":"contact_country","value":false}]]},{"pieces":[{"text":2}],"when":[[{"type":"other","key":"is_nomadic","arg":"no","scope":"owner","value":false},{"type":"other","key":"is_same_value","arg":"event_target:caravaneer_home_country","scope":"contact_country","value":false}]]},{"pieces":[{"text":3}],"when":[[{"type":"other","key":"is_same_value","arg":"event_target:caravaneer_home_country","scope":"contact_country","value":true}]]}],"names":{"This.Leader.GetName":{"zh":"这位领袖","en":"the leader"},"This.System.GetName":{"zh":"这个星系","en":"this system"}}},{"id":"first_contact_critters.75","kind":"event","title":{"zh":"行商","en":"The Caravaneers"},"texts":[{"zh":"我们已经成功地破译了[This.ContactCountry.GetName]向我们发送的令人困惑的重复信息，我们发现这些信息是一些……商业广告！显然他们自称为[This.ContactCountry.GetRealName]，是一个以向偶遇的任何文明提供最优惠的交易谋生的星际商团的一部分，至少他们自称是最优惠的。一如既往，他们似乎正在尝试联系我们。","en":"We have managed to decipher the confusing, repetitive messages the [This.ContactCountry.GetName] were sending us, and it turns out that they were... commercial advertisements! Apparently they call themselves [This.ContactCountry.GetRealName] and are part of a group of spacefaring traders that make a living by offering the best deals - or what they claim to be the best deals - to whichever civilization they happen to be visiting at the time. True to form, it appears they are attempting to contact us."},{"zh":"我们已经成功地破译了[This.ContactCountry.GetName]向我们发送的，一遍又一遍的，令人困惑的信息，我们发现这些信息竟是一些……商业广告！似乎[This.System.GetName]恒星系是一个自称[This.ContactCountry.GetRealName]的星际商团的母星系。显然，他们以向偶遇的任何文明提供最优惠的交易谋生，至少他们自称是最优惠的。","en":"We have managed to decipher the confusing, repetitive messages the [This.ContactCountry.GetName] were sending us, and it turns out that they were... commercial advertisements! It appears that the [This.System.GetName] system is the home system of a group of spacefaring traders that call themselves the [This.ContactCountry.GetRealName]. They apparently make a living by offering the best deals - or what they claim to be the best deals - to whichever civilization they happen to be visiting at the time."}],"sections":[],"image":"art/b7ef4b47c87fbcb9cdc6.webp","hidden":false,"choices":[{"key":"ON_SCREEN","label":{"zh":"显示在屏幕上。","en":"On screen."},"responses":[],"tooltips":[],"conditional":true,"next":[{"target":"galactic_features.387","kind":"option","conditional":true,"delayed":false,"sourceKind":"option","group":"c1","when":[[[{"type":"other","key":"is_country_type","arg":"default","scope":"contact_country","value":false}],[{"type":"other","key":"has_first_contact_flag","arg":"hostile_first_contact_attempted","scope":"","value":true}]],[[{"type":"flag","scope":"country","name":"tiyanki_graveyard_survey","path":"","value":true}]]],"source":"common/scripted_effects/first_contact_effects.txt:178","story":"event-galactic-features-387"},{"target":"cara.1020","kind":"option","conditional":true,"delayed":false,"sourceKind":"option","group":"c1","when":[[[{"type":"other","key":"is_country_type","arg":"default","scope":"contact_country","value":false}],[{"type":"other","key":"has_first_contact_flag","arg":"hostile_first_contact_attempted","scope":"","value":true}]],[[{"type":"other","key":"any_country","arg":"{…}","scope":"","value":true}]],[[{"type":"other","key":"exists","arg":"event_target:caravaneer_fleet1_country","scope":"","value":true},{"type":"other","key":"is_same_value","arg":"event_target:caravaneer_fleet1_country","scope":"","value":true}]]],"source":"common/scripted_effects/first_contact_effects.txt:437","story":"event-cara-1010"},{"target":"cara.2020","kind":"option","conditional":true,"delayed":false,"sourceKind":"option","group":"c1","when":[[[{"type":"other","key":"is_country_type","arg":"default","scope":"contact_country","value":false}],[{"type":"other","key":"has_first_contact_flag","arg":"hostile_first_contact_attempted","scope":"","value":true}]],[[{"type":"other","key":"any_country","arg":"{…}","scope":"","value":true}]],[[{"type":"other","key":"exists","arg":"event_target:caravaneer_fleet2_country","scope":"","value":true}